  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0 — Security fix: escape RediSearch query-syntax special characters in LIKE patterns before adding wildcards, closing a query-injection vector (e.g. a pattern containing ')' or '|' could previously break out of the field's scope). Fix customConverter not being applied in VisitComparison/numeric VisitIn. Add a MaxInValues cap (1,000). Instrument Translate(...) with ValiFlowDiagnostics Activity tracing. No breaking changes.",
